# Web Compose build context 是仓库根；从空上下文开始逐项放行构建输入。
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml

!packages/
!packages/configs/
!packages/configs/*/
!packages/configs/*/*.cjs
!packages/configs/*/*.css
!packages/configs/*/*.js
!packages/configs/*/*.json

!apps/
!apps/vite-app/
!apps/vite-app/Dockerfile
!apps/vite-app/capacitor.config.ts
!apps/vite-app/index.html
!apps/vite-app/nginx.conf
!apps/vite-app/package.json
!apps/vite-app/playwright.config.ts
!apps/vite-app/postcss.config.js
!apps/vite-app/tsconfig.json
!apps/vite-app/vite.config.ts
!apps/vite-app/vitest.config.ts
!apps/vite-app/public/
!apps/vite-app/public/**
!apps/vite-app/scripts/
!apps/vite-app/scripts/**
!apps/vite-app/src/
!apps/vite-app/src/**
apps/vite-app/src/**/*.test.ts
apps/vite-app/src/**/*.test.tsx

# 宽泛目录放行后必须再次排除任意层级的本地秘密、元数据与构建/测试缓存。
**/.env*
**/.npmrc
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.agents
**/.agents/**
**/.codex
**/.codex/**
**/.review
**/.review/**
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/dist
**/dist/**
**/.turbo
**/.turbo/**
**/.vite
**/.vite/**
**/coverage
**/coverage/**
**/.cache
**/.cache/**
**/.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.nyc_output
**/.nyc_output/**
**/test-results
**/test-results/**
**/playwright-report
**/playwright-report/**
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.eslintcache
**/.prettiercache
**/.coverage*

# 仅恢复两份 tracked 公开 Vite mode 文件；其他 dotenv 保持排除。
!apps/vite-app/.env.development
!apps/vite-app/.env.production
